WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.550 line:78% position:50% align:center
The tallest building on Earth
is only the beginning.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:07.150 line:78% position:50% align:center
Burj Khalifa rises 828 meters.

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:13.550 line:78% position:50% align:center
The Three Gorges Dam stretches about 2.3 kilometers,
nearly three Burj Khalifas.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:19.500 line:78% position:50% align:center
CERN's Large Hadron Collider forms
a 26.7-kilometer ring underground.

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:25.350 line:78% position:50% align:center
But Switzerland's Gotthard Base Tunnel runs
57.1 kilometers through the Alps.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:30.300 line:78% position:50% align:center
End to end, almost 69 Burj Khalifas
would fit inside it.
